Architecture: darwin-arm64
Priority: standard
Section: libs
Depends: libsystem
Description: packet capture library
 libpcap provides packet capture, BPF filter compilation and offline
 capture-file reading and writing, including pcapng support.

Package: libpcap-dev
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Priority: optional
Section: libdevel
Depends: libpcap (= ${binary:Version})
Description: packet capture library: development files
 Public libpcap headers and the private pcap-util.h for building
 packet capture tools.
